# Files that belong to the source checkout, not to the plugin people install.
#
# `wp dist-archive .` reads this when building the zip. Everything listed
# here exists to develop the plugin - version control, the block build
# toolchain, the pre-commit lint hook - and Plugin Check rightly objects to
# any of it turning up in a release.
#
# What is NOT listed is deliberate: build/ holds the compiled block editor
# script and src/ is the JSX it is compiled from, both of which WordPress.org
# expects to receive so the build can be reproduced.

.git
.gitignore
.githooks
.distignore
.DS_Store
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
